{"id":"furaca_o","lemma":"furacão","pos":"noun","rank":3872,"glosses":["hurricane"],"ipa":"/fu.ɾɐˈkɐ̃w̃/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"furacões"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-furac%C3%A3o.wav","examples":[{"text":"Furacões são muito destrutivos.","en":"Hurricanes are very destructive.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"very / a lot"},null]},{"text":"Os furacões são tempestades violentas.","en":"Hurricanes are violent storms.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"storm","l":"tempestade"},{"g":"violent","l":"violento"}]},{"text":"Um furacão destruiu a casa do Tom.","en":"A hurricane destroyed Tom's house.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to ruin, devastate","l":"destruir"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"tone"}]},{"text":"O grande número de mortos pelo furacão subiu para 200.","en":"The death toll from the hurricane climbed to 200.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"large"},{"g":"number"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"dead","l":"morto"},{"g":"by / for the","l":"pelar"},null,{"g":"to ascend, to go up","l":"subir"},{"g":"for / to"}]},{"text":"Os furacões geralmente ocorrem em junho.","en":"Hurricanes usually occur in June.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"generally, usually"},{"g":"to occur, happen","l":"ocorrer"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"June"}]}]}